# `ryzers build` sends this package directory to the daemon as the build
# context, and config.yaml bind-mounts workspace/ into the running container for
# fine-tune checkpoints (~11 GB each) and rendered videos. Without this, every
# rebuild after a workshop run would upload all of that.
workspace/
